NAME
  setsockopt - KNUCK syscall

SYNOPSIS
  setsockopt(fd, level, opt, val)

DESCRIPTION
  Set a socket option. SOL_SOCKET=1: SO_REUSEADDR=2, SO_BROADCAST=6, SO_RCVTIMEO=20. HTTP level=2: METHOD=1, HEADERS=2, BODY=3.

RETURN VALUES
  true or nil,err

SEE ALSO
  getsockopt

KNUCK(2) manual page. Part of the KNUCK kernel distribution.
